RENDEZ-VOUS IN PARIS – The 5th edition is coming!\
\
The Rendez-vous in Paris event features a program including 4 Roller Parties with prestigious French and international DJs in a festive atmosphere.

1 musical roller skate ride along the Seine River Quays – Olympic Village

A conference on the influence of roller skating on music: “What is Skate Music”

A dozen roller dance workshops, led by professional instructors.

Whether you are a skater or simply curious, come celebrate culture and festivities in Paris and its surroundings from June 18 to June 21, 2026.
An event open to everyone not to be missed!\
\
🌍 Join us for an unforgettable experience\
